  "details": "Version: Window 2020.1.1p5 (w_2020.1.1p5)\n\nDescription of the bug:\nThis problem may relate to https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrchat-not-closing.\nA new window appears when closing VRChat (Installation Manager). I've attached a screenshot. The game doesn't close correctly because of this window. I'm unsure if this is a bug or intended.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nClose VRChat\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nSee attachments.",
